yuf phone numbers (src/phone/)

This folder contains code and data adapted from:

- libphonenumber-for-php, https://github.com/giggsey/libphonenumber-for-php
  by Joshua Gigg and contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
- libphonenumber, https://github.com/google/libphonenumber
  by The Libphonenumber Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The full license text is in the file LICENSE in this folder. Neither project ships a NOTICE file.

Changes by Actra AG (https://www.actra.ch), marked in every changed file:

- Reduced to parsing, formatting (E.164, international, national) and validation of phone numbers; geocoding,
  carrier, time zone, short number and "as you type" features are removed.
- Classes renamed and restructured into the namespace actra\yuf\phone, rewritten to PHP 8.5 and the Actra coding
  standard (strict types, enums, immutable objects).
- Metadata (src/phone/data/) taken over from libphonenumber-for-php with a changed file header.

The adapted files are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, like the original. The rest of yuf is licensed
under the MIT License (see the file LICENSE in the root folder of yuf).
